          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: पुरा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुरा — purā — \"long ago; formerly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुरा अत्र एकः राजा वसति स्म। purā atra ekaḥ rājā vasati sma. Long ago a king lived here."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुरा (purā) MW gives purā as before, formerly, of old, and compares puras and pūrva, but gives no root, so its origin is left uncertain here (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
