          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "इतिवृत्तम् (itivṛttam) is built from iti, \"thus\", and vṛtta, \"happened\": what happened thus; MW gives itivṛtta as an occurrence, an event, and a chronicle is its modern use (MW)."
